OL,3,GNEWSANonagenarian artist still inspired
OL,4,Aby iconic landscape
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If you love doing what you love to do,
OL,7,Fwhy would you stop doing it?" asks
OL,8,Fartist Jeanie Mellersh.
OL,10,FThe 90-year-old has unveiled a new
OL,11,Fexhibition of her work, inspired by the
OL,12,Ficonic Hampshire landscape she calls
OL,13,Fhome, which will raise money for a
OL,14,Fcharity supporting neuro-disabled
OL,15,Fpeople.
OL,17,FIn 1968, Mellersh moved to the New
OL,18,FForest from Liverpool and has been
OL,19,Fusing the location as inspiration ever
OL,20,Fsince.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
