OL,3,GNEWSANonagenarian artist still inspired
OL,4,Aby iconic landscape
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I go walking with my husband, we
OL,7,Ftake sketchbooks and we sit on a log
OL,8,Fand draw what we see," she said. "I
OL,9,Flook up and I think, wow, this is just
OL,10,Fa beautiful green cathedral."
